Package: neuroarchive
Type: Package
Title: Latent NeuroArchive Data Format Tools
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Brad", "Buchsbaum", , "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Read, write, validate, and lazily access Latent NeuroArchive
    (LNA) files, an HDF5-based format for transform-aware compression of
    neuroimaging data. The package stores reconstruction pipelines, spatial
    metadata, and shared basis references so compressed fMRI archives can be
    inspected, validated, and reconstructed in downstream workflows.
URL: https://github.com/bbuchsbaum/neuroarchive
BugReports: https://github.com/bbuchsbaum/neuroarchive/issues
